<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:bg><p:bgPr><a:gradFill rotWithShape="1"><a:gsLst><a:gs pos="36000"><a:srgbClr val="357D95"/></a:gs><a:gs pos="100000"><a:schemeClr val="tx1"/></a:gs></a:gsLst><a:lin ang="6120000" scaled="1"/></a:gradFill><a:effectLst/></p:bgPr></p:bg><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{F6B426B2-D509-248A-6677-A1CA190B04E1}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Content Placeholder 2"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{7C4F4B85-D70C-B1AE-7A65-8E9707CCA887}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="677583" y="2014095"/><a:ext cx="11744638" cy="7245146"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr anchor="t"><a:normAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>At The Howell Group, we provide services from concept to completion and are accustomed to overseeing and managing a single or multiple projects as part of an overall program.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Program Management.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> Is the process of managing several related projects in a coordinated manner with oversight of and focus on the client’s purpose.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Design Management.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> Is the process of managing the development of a project’s design with a focus on the client’s needs regarding duration, milestones, and cost.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Construction Management.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> Is the process of managing the overall construction with a focus on scope of work, quality, schedule, cost, safety, and function.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Contract Management.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> Is a process by which we generate and negotiate on the client’s behalf to determine the most effective contract agreement.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Financial Management.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t> We have partnered with a capital financial advisor and are able to provide financial solutions, including; mergers &amp; acquisitions, direct investment, private equity, private debt, collateralized funding, divestitures, strategic alliances, recapitalization &amp; refinancing, management buyouts, grants, and alternative financing (equipment leasing and energy-as-a-service)</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0" algn="ctr"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>The Howell Group, LLC</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0" algn="ctr"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:hlinkClick r:id="rId2"/></a:rPr><a:t>info@thehowellgroup.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>  949-610-5111</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr id="6" name="Picture 5"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{55F252D2-46ED-3812-5C05-881E44BABBA7}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvPicPr><a:picLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></p:cNvPicPr><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{28A0092B-C50C-407E-A947-70E740481C1C}"><a14:useLocalDpi xmlns:a14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2010/main" val="0"/></a:ext></a:extLst></a:blip><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="13189705" y="8444090"/><a:ext cx="1448315" cy="815151"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr></p:pic><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Title 1"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{A4AF97C9-3E2F-AE9C-DF0E-23563449525F}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"><a:spLocks/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="677583" y="1440557"/><a:ext cx="10061643" cy="436881"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:effectLst/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr vert="horz" lIns="91440" tIns="45720" rIns="91440" bIns="45720" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"><a:noAutofi